ner's `betas`, `user_profile_id` and `workspace_id` when `set_messages_params()` leaves them out\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **deps:** bump certifi in the dev lockfile\n* **docs:** clarify plugin content scan and validation descriptions\n* **docs:** clarify plugin served_version_pinned and updated_at\n* **docs:** fix usage and cost report examples and ending_at docs\n* **docs:** rate limit model lists vary by organization and workspace"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v2.1.0","id":420098160,"author":{"login":"anthropic-sdks-releaser[bot]","id":336223496,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFApdCA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-sdks-releaser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/received_events